WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.235
- They had me.

00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:05.035
They had the door locked behind me

00:00:05.035 --> 00:00:07.914
and they were keeping me against my will.

00:00:07.914 --> 00:00:11.414
(ping pong ball bouncing)

00:00:36.465 --> 00:00:38.965
There's so much inside me that's broken

00:00:38.965 --> 00:00:41.126
and damaged from all of this.

00:00:41.126 --> 00:00:44.626
(slow instrumental music)

00:00:46.242 --> 00:00:48.998
- [Worker] A lot of times we did admit who

00:00:48.998 --> 00:00:52.349
didn't necessarily need
inpatient level of treatment

00:00:52.349 --> 00:00:54.027
but we were encouraged to

00:00:54.027 --> 00:00:56.915
admit as many people as possible.

00:00:56.915 --> 00:01:01.004
(slow instrumental music)

00:01:01.004 --> 00:01:03.886
We were really encouraged to

00:01:03.886 --> 00:01:05.345
kinda make a story

00:01:05.345 --> 00:01:07.455
that sometimes looked more severe

00:01:07.455 --> 00:01:09.852
on paper than it probably actually was.

00:01:09.852 --> 00:01:11.689
- I made the comment

00:01:11.689 --> 00:01:16.383
you know, it's Texas, it's
not that hard to find a gun.

00:01:16.383 --> 00:01:18.690
Never in my wildest dreams

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:22.201
would I have imagined that joking comment

00:01:22.201 --> 00:01:25.334
would be the absolute
crux of why they thought

00:01:25.334 --> 00:01:29.552
they were going to hold
me against my will.

00:01:29.552 --> 00:01:32.344
I was walked down a long hallway

00:01:32.344 --> 00:01:35.814
where you normally see what I
thought was doctor's offices,

00:01:35.814 --> 00:01:39.481
and they weren't, but
it was hospital rooms.

00:01:40.369 --> 00:01:43.241
At that point,

00:01:43.241 --> 00:01:46.074
I realized something wasn't right.

00:01:48.407 --> 00:01:50.497
I kept saying, I'd like to access,

00:01:50.497 --> 00:01:53.588
I'd like a second opinion,
I'd like to leave.

00:01:53.588 --> 00:01:54.996
I mean, I called the police,

00:01:54.996 --> 00:01:56.841
I asked them to let me go,

00:01:56.841 --> 00:01:59.396
to let the police officers
see the paperwork.

00:01:59.396 --> 00:02:01.416
They wouldn't tell them anything,

00:02:01.416 --> 00:02:03.406
they wouldn't tell me anything.

00:02:03.406 --> 00:02:06.906
(slow instrumental music)

00:02:22.626 --> 00:02:26.043
They take you out of your life

00:02:28.466 --> 00:02:30.649
and they hold you like a prisoner,

00:02:30.649 --> 00:02:31.482
like a criminal.

00:02:31.482 --> 00:02:34.235
- [Worker] It did kinda
seem like a trap at times

00:02:34.235 --> 00:02:35.881
Most people didn't know

00:02:35.881 --> 00:02:38.269
what they were coming into.

00:02:38.269 --> 00:02:41.852
(slow instrumental music)

